WEBVTT

00:15.080 --> 00:15.950
Damn it.

00:16.710 --> 00:20.790
<i>What's inside the bandages?</i>
<i>It's disgusting.</i>

00:27.590 --> 00:29.930
If you're caught again,
you're as good as dead.

00:30.300 --> 00:33.640
Old dude...
How did you know I was here?

00:34.350 --> 00:35.930
Because I'm a monster.

00:36.680 --> 00:39.020
This is our chance to
earn some points. Kill 'em!

00:39.060 --> 00:40.650
Hm? I'm pretty sure this guys is...

00:42.060 --> 00:43.310
the Hero Hunter...

00:48.240 --> 00:50.320
I got my revenge.

00:50.950 --> 00:54.530
I've got no other business here,
so I'm outta here.

00:55.740 --> 00:57.750
If you're tagging along,
keep your mouth shut.

00:58.710 --> 01:00.500
W-Wait!

01:01.420 --> 01:04.630
I can't run that fast, old dude.

01:04.960 --> 01:07.590
You're hurt.
Are you okay moving around?

01:07.800 --> 01:10.930
Maybe you should hide
somewhere and rest.

01:11.180 --> 01:12.840
They've figured out our location.

01:13.340 --> 01:15.930
There's a monster with
that kind of power.

01:16.350 --> 01:19.270
If we stand still,
we'll be swarmed by assassins.

01:19.890 --> 01:23.020
But luckily,
they have their hands full

01:23.230 --> 01:25.770
so they're not putting all their effort
into coming after me.

01:26.230 --> 01:27.980
I’ll take out anyone in my way

01:27.980 --> 01:29.860
and exit by the shortest route.

01:30.490 --> 01:31.650
Um...

01:31.700 --> 01:33.870
The thing is...
there's another hostage.

01:35.780 --> 01:37.370
He's about my age!

01:37.490 --> 01:38.330
Who cares?

01:38.910 --> 01:41.000
You have to help him!

01:41.290 --> 01:42.620
Listen...

01:42.920 --> 01:45.380
Don't get the wrong idea.

01:45.500 --> 01:48.130
I didn't come to help you.

01:48.760 --> 01:49.800
What the...?

01:51.840 --> 01:53.760
What the hell is that?

01:55.800 --> 01:58.100
You idiot. Don't turn around.

01:58.430 --> 02:00.350
Slowly walk towards me
one step at a time...

02:06.860 --> 02:09.900
<i>My heart's racing.</i>
<i>My skin's tingling.</i>

02:10.610 --> 02:12.650
<i>This is...definitely a red flag.</i>

02:13.820 --> 02:15.120
<i>This thing is strong.</i>

02:15.490 --> 02:18.370
<i>Fighting it here is</i>
<i>the last thing I want.</i>

02:19.660 --> 02:22.040
- Old dude...
- Shh! Quiet.

02:22.410 --> 02:23.670
Don't provoke it...

02:24.330 --> 02:25.710
Slowly...

02:26.000 --> 02:27.590
Just move... carefully...

02:30.380 --> 02:31.420
Go...

02:31.880 --> 02:32.970
But don't run...

02:37.260 --> 02:40.350
Alright...
It's not coming after us.

02:40.970 --> 02:43.230
As long as we don't show hostility,
we're good.

02:43.810 --> 02:45.810
Looks like we can get through this
without a fight.

02:46.980 --> 02:48.150
Phew...

02:48.270 --> 02:50.650
At this distance, we should be safe.

02:51.900 --> 02:52.150
MONSTER KING

02:52.150 --> 02:54.740
MONSTER KING
So...it's you...

02:54.740 --> 02:54.990
So...it's you...

02:55.570 --> 02:55.860
You've decided to
join the humans, huh?

02:55.860 --> 02:59.450
THREAT LEVEL: DEMON
SUPER MOUSE
You've decided to
join the humans, huh?

02:59.660 --> 03:00.120
This guy...
He's that Hero Hunter, right?

03:00.120 --> 03:02.250
THREAT LEVEL: DEMON
UNIHORN
This guy...
He's that Hero Hunter, right?

03:02.290 --> 03:04.910
THREAT LEVEL: DEMON
UNIHORN
Looks like you've gotten
a little too full of yourself.

03:04.910 --> 03:04.990
Looks like you've gotten
a little too full of yourself.

03:05.330 --> 03:05.670
You should've sided with us
from the start, Hero Hunter!

03:05.670 --> 03:09.040
THREAT LEVEL: DEMON
SHOWERHEAD
You should've sided with us
from the start, Hero Hunter!

03:09.040 --> 03:09.420
THREAT LEVEL: DEMON
SHOWERHEAD

03:09.420 --> 03:12.670
THREAT LEVEL: DEMON
SHOWERHEAD
As you wish,
I'll douse you with toxic chemicals.

03:12.670 --> 03:13.920
As you wish,
I'll douse you with toxic chemicals.

03:14.170 --> 03:16.130
So just die already!

03:28.060 --> 03:29.770
This... This guy's tough!

03:35.610 --> 03:36.700
Wow...

03:36.700 --> 03:37.610
Old dude...

03:38.360 --> 03:39.990
You're getting even stronger...

03:42.950 --> 03:43.790
Oh...!

03:44.000 --> 03:47.620
So you really do live up
to the name Hero Hunter.

03:48.580 --> 03:51.420
I'm used to being outnumbered.

03:51.500 --> 03:54.050
Yeah, but we're all threat-level Demon!

03:54.590 --> 03:58.430
Hmm...then I must
be threat-level Dragon.

03:58.510 --> 04:01.010
Hey, don't get cocky.

04:01.100 --> 04:05.020
Threat-level Dragon is for
Monster Association's top brass.

04:05.060 --> 04:07.310
You're nowhere near that level.

04:07.640 --> 04:10.230
Besides, you think you've already won?

04:10.360 --> 04:11.270
Don't be naive!

04:11.480 --> 04:12.570
Die!

04:12.610 --> 04:14.650
I've got the world's hardest horn.

04:19.160 --> 04:21.570
Humph. They're all nothing special...

04:26.120 --> 04:27.620
Ah, crap.

04:27.750 --> 04:29.750
Old dude, it's bad over there.

04:32.540 --> 04:34.750
H-Helllp! Ugh.

04:39.130 --> 04:42.300
I thought it was
the world's hardest horn.

04:42.890 --> 04:43.850
Pochi...

04:44.100 --> 04:45.270
This is bad.

04:45.390 --> 04:46.890
You pissed off one our high rankers.

04:47.100 --> 04:49.770
This thing's a high ranker?
It's just a dog!

04:49.940 --> 04:52.270
Our hierarchy is based
on destructiveness.

04:52.690 --> 04:54.230
<i>So, what now?</i>

04:56.690 --> 04:59.860
THREAT LEVEL: DRAGON
OVERGROWN POCHI

05:00.610 --> 05:01.910
Whoa, what the hell!

05:05.160 --> 05:07.580
With my regeneration,
I should be able to recover.

05:13.580 --> 05:16.420
RUMBLE BOOM

05:16.500 --> 05:17.010
RATTLE

05:17.010 --> 05:18.630
RATTLE
Oh...an earthquake?

05:18.880 --> 05:20.260
I wonder where the epicenter was.

05:21.630 --> 05:23.850
FLOP
After I read this,
maybe I'll go patrol the area.

05:23.850 --> 05:24.550
FLOP

05:40.070 --> 05:43.110
<i>So this is how strong the Monster</i>
<i>Associations' high rankers are?</i>

05:43.700 --> 05:45.780
<i>This is threat-level Dragon!!</i>

05:46.950 --> 05:49.120
This is where we split up!

05:50.370 --> 05:52.620
Why the hell are you
just standing there?

05:52.620 --> 05:54.080
Hurry up and move it!

05:54.330 --> 05:57.920
N-No way.
I'd never survive alone!

05:58.050 --> 06:00.840
So what? That's not my problem.

06:01.010 --> 06:01.840
But...

06:01.880 --> 06:04.390
You're gonna drag me down
and get me killed too!

06:05.010 --> 06:09.220
You got lucky and survived.
Now take care of yourself!

06:22.700 --> 06:24.530
Hey, keep your eyes on me!

06:35.920 --> 06:37.670
How's that?
Was it even a little...

06:41.380 --> 06:43.090
Too...close...

06:45.050 --> 06:46.760
DEATH

06:48.050 --> 06:49.100
<i>I'm dead!</i>

06:49.220 --> 06:51.470
<i>Damn it. Here, of all places.</i>

06:51.560 --> 06:54.480
<i>I said I wanna fight</i>
<i>monster-class heroes.</i>

06:54.560 --> 06:57.400
<i>I never once said</i>
<i>I wanna fight monsters!</i>

06:58.690 --> 07:00.320
<i>I wanna drink a cola so bad.</i>

07:00.440 --> 07:03.570
<i>I'm not even halfway done!</i>
<i>But this is the end...</i>

08:16.350 --> 08:19.400
Don't get cocky, you damn mutt!

08:23.980 --> 08:29.360
Sit... Dog...gyyy!!

08:38.710 --> 08:41.040
Even my best shot didn't do a thing!

08:53.140 --> 08:55.060
RUMBLE BOOM

08:55.140 --> 08:57.100
SHAKING

09:03.940 --> 09:06.730
<i>I've fallen pretty deep</i>
<i>into the lower levels.</i>

09:06.980 --> 09:08.110
<i>Damn it.</i>

09:08.190 --> 09:10.280
<i>I must get back up there.</i>

09:10.990 --> 09:13.200
Ugh...I can't move.

09:13.530 --> 09:18.330
Well, look who dropped in.
So you're the intruder.

09:19.250 --> 09:21.830
Well, this is wonderful.

09:21.870 --> 09:24.790
You've lived up to my expectations.

09:24.880 --> 09:27.050
You didn't die, after all.

09:27.420 --> 09:28.670
I'm truly pleased.

09:36.720 --> 09:39.350
<i>The power to move things remotely...</i>

09:39.480 --> 09:41.020
<i>So that's telekinesis, huh?</i>

09:41.440 --> 09:42.770
Gyoro-Gyoro...

09:43.060 --> 09:45.400
How dare you have your goons
come after me.

09:45.730 --> 09:47.860
You've made this
a huge pain in the ass.

09:49.940 --> 09:52.820
What just happened?

09:53.200 --> 09:54.280
<i>I can't move...</i>

09:54.410 --> 09:55.990
There's no point in resisting.

09:56.870 --> 10:00.120
<i>In such a short time,</i>
<i>he has grown so much.</i>

10:00.790 --> 10:05.630
Hey... Release me right now...

10:05.840 --> 10:07.040
Or else...

10:14.390 --> 10:14.720
Let's chat a bit, shall we?

10:14.720 --> 10:16.640
THREAT LEVEL: DRAGON
GYORO-GYORO
Let's chat a bit, shall we?

10:17.430 --> 10:19.390
BRUSHING

10:19.470 --> 10:21.100
PULLING

10:27.440 --> 10:31.110
Right now,
you're still only a half-monster.

10:31.650 --> 10:35.280
But it's terrifying that
you have the physical strength

10:35.280 --> 10:37.580
to be able to endure Pochi's
concentrated heat blasts.

10:38.120 --> 10:40.580
But it's still not enough.

10:42.540 --> 10:47.130
I can train you to become
the most powerful monster.

10:47.880 --> 10:49.920
You train me?

10:50.340 --> 10:53.050
So you're gonna teach me telekinesis?

10:53.590 --> 10:57.180
What I teach is neither
psychic powers nor martial arts.

10:57.510 --> 10:59.470
I will teach you the secret art
of monsterization.

10:59.970 --> 11:01.220
To put it simply

11:01.220 --> 11:04.270
you must repeatedly overcome death
as a human being.

11:04.390 --> 11:08.400
Subjecting both body and mind
to overwhelming, abnormal strain.

11:09.020 --> 11:12.030
It sounds simple,
but in truth it's incredibly difficult.

11:12.150 --> 11:14.490
Most subjects die right away.

11:14.780 --> 11:19.990
The key is to make them experience
a hell precisely tailored to their level.

11:20.450 --> 11:22.870
Sounds like
you've done it a few times.

11:22.910 --> 11:28.420
More than a few. I've used
countless humans and monsters.

11:28.960 --> 11:33.380
Monsterization became easy

11:33.380 --> 11:37.470
but the transformations only reflected
the individual's natural talents.

11:37.550 --> 11:40.430
There was no further growth.

11:41.100 --> 11:45.980
I desperately wanted to know how
to surpass the limits of growth.

11:46.230 --> 11:48.900
I tried feeding
monsters to other monsters

11:48.900 --> 11:52.570
transplanting blood and cells,
and forced breeding.

11:52.570 --> 11:54.990
I tried everything I could think of.

11:55.530 --> 11:56.990
And through that process

11:56.990 --> 12:01.240
I realized that by overcoming death,
you ascend to a higher stage.

12:01.370 --> 12:05.000
With each repetition,
they show explosive growth.

12:05.660 --> 12:08.370
A mountain of failures piled up.

12:08.670 --> 12:11.750
Then I found my first success...

12:12.210 --> 12:14.670
Monster King Orochi.

12:14.880 --> 12:18.470
But you hold even
greater potential than him.

12:18.590 --> 12:20.850
After you clashed with King the Ripper

12:20.850 --> 12:23.470
you broke through another wall.

12:23.760 --> 12:26.140
Your monsterization
is progressing steadily.

12:26.140 --> 12:28.140
You're becoming stronger and stronger.

12:28.190 --> 12:30.600
If you follow my training program

12:30.600 --> 12:32.570
you could become a monster like Orochi...

12:32.650 --> 12:36.490
Or even surpass him.

12:36.780 --> 12:38.070
Let's join forces.

12:38.450 --> 12:40.110
You can become
the most powerful monster

12:40.110 --> 12:43.120
and together we can erase
every hero from this world.

12:43.330 --> 12:45.240
I'll make your dreams come true.

12:45.540 --> 12:47.080
I don't need your help.

12:47.160 --> 12:48.750
I never want anything
to do with you.

12:48.960 --> 12:50.880
From the moment
I set my eyes on you

12:50.880 --> 12:53.090
refusal was no longer an option.

12:53.210 --> 12:57.380
I really hate guys who just sit back
and watch from above.

12:57.510 --> 12:59.300
Makes me want to drag them
down to the bottom.

13:00.380 --> 13:03.970
You're all talk.
You can't even move.

13:04.890 --> 13:07.100
This is my psychic power.

13:07.140 --> 13:11.230
Surpassing even Tornado and Blizzard,
the famed witch sisters.

13:11.230 --> 13:12.810
My powers are godly.

13:15.320 --> 13:20.780
Little...by little...
Little by little...

13:21.280 --> 13:23.320
I'm getting used to it.

13:23.450 --> 13:25.080
Why can you still move?

13:25.830 --> 13:27.080
Who knows?

13:27.620 --> 13:30.620
Maybe this is what
they call sheer willpower.

13:31.210 --> 13:33.210
<i>His ability to adapt is extraordinary.</i>

13:33.330 --> 13:36.130
<i>Taming him will not be easy.</i>

13:37.130 --> 13:39.800
I'll train you through pain.

13:56.230 --> 13:58.820
So that's all you've got?

13:59.070 --> 14:02.820
Hard to believe you're the
Monster Association's top strategist.

14:03.490 --> 14:06.370
When you hurl something,
the paralysis wears off.

14:06.700 --> 14:09.910
You can only focus on
one action at a time.

14:10.250 --> 14:13.040
That's why I can block it in an instant,
so you're no threat to me.

14:13.120 --> 14:15.580
Your psychic powers don't
scare me one damn bit.

14:19.760 --> 14:22.220
The only mediocre monster here is you!

14:22.840 --> 14:27.010
You don't have what it takes
to train a genius like me!

14:27.560 --> 14:30.640
I'm lucky that I dropped in
just where I needed to be.

14:30.980 --> 14:33.440
If I just crush the brains behind
the Monster Association

14:33.560 --> 14:35.520
the rest will collapse on its own.

14:40.610 --> 14:41.610
It's hunting time.

14:42.030 --> 14:46.950
The heroes are coming,
so don't tire me out.

14:47.410 --> 14:50.910
I need to preserve my energy.

14:51.370 --> 14:53.080
So...

14:53.370 --> 14:56.880
Lord Orochi! Finish him off!

14:58.000 --> 14:59.000
What?

15:04.170 --> 15:05.800
I wish you luck.

15:06.720 --> 15:07.550
Damn you.

15:22.690 --> 15:24.820
Ah, so it ends here, huh?

15:24.950 --> 15:26.450
I wanna know what happens next.

15:27.110 --> 15:27.910
BOOM

15:27.910 --> 15:29.910
BOOM
<i>Oh, there's that rumbling</i>
<i>and noise again.</i>

15:30.740 --> 15:33.080
RUMBLE
<i>This feels like something</i>
<i>out of the manga I'm reading.</i>

15:33.080 --> 15:34.160
RUMBLE

15:34.160 --> 15:36.540
<i>-Come to think of it, in real life, you never see stuff like</i>

15:36.540 --> 15:39.170
BOOM
<i>a super-strong boss behind</i>
<i>the enemy organization.</i>

15:39.170 --> 15:39.750
RUMBLE
<i>a super-strong boss behind</i>
<i>the enemy organization.</i>

15:39.750 --> 15:42.630
RUMBLE

15:42.630 --> 15:44.510
RUMBLE
<i>And things like final bosses</i>
<i>don't even exist.</i>

15:44.510 --> 15:45.090
<i>And things like final bosses</i>
<i>don't even exist.</i>

15:45.800 --> 15:47.800
RUMBLE

15:47.970 --> 15:48.140
Hold on.
Things are about to get crazy...

15:48.140 --> 15:50.010
ROAR BOOM
Hold on.
Things are about to get crazy...

15:50.100 --> 15:52.510
KABOOM

15:53.680 --> 15:57.440
<i>Reality is nothing like manga.</i>
<i>There's nothing fun about it.</i>

15:58.440 --> 16:03.280
Lord Orochi! I have plans for him,
so don't kill him.

16:13.290 --> 16:15.870
Oh? You're still getting back up?

16:16.210 --> 16:18.710
Where does that
tenacity even come from?

16:19.120 --> 16:21.500
Well, not that it really matters.

16:45.440 --> 16:48.400
The horns were
the first part to manifest

16:48.400 --> 16:50.660
when Lord Orochi transformed
from human to monster.

16:51.200 --> 16:54.120
They've got incredible reach,
and he can control them freely.

16:54.240 --> 16:55.830
They're quite formidable, aren't they?

17:03.090 --> 17:04.590
No problem.

17:05.460 --> 17:10.260
I already got a hole
blown through my torso earlier...

17:46.130 --> 17:47.500
<i>He's getting faster.</i>

17:59.560 --> 18:01.690
<i>This is going nowhere</i>
<i>if I just keep dodging.</i>

18:09.780 --> 18:12.650
<i>Since he was once human, his vital points</i>
<i>should be in the same place.</i>

18:13.030 --> 18:15.070
<i>I'll hammer it into that massive target.</i>

18:23.960 --> 18:24.790
What the—?!

18:38.350 --> 18:40.020
Whoa!

18:40.180 --> 18:43.310
First, a dog monster and
now a giant worm boss?

18:45.560 --> 18:46.400
<i>Crap.</i>

18:57.780 --> 19:00.910
<i>He easily withstands extreme heat.</i>

19:47.210 --> 19:50.090
Lord Orochi has been perfected
as the ultimate lifeform.

19:50.090 --> 19:54.090
Your level is far beneath his.
Give up already.

19:59.180 --> 20:00.640
Don't make me laugh.

20:01.390 --> 20:06.020
I'm a genius,
so the same attacks won't work twice.

20:06.690 --> 20:09.150
Watch carefully,
I'm about to turn this around.

20:09.980 --> 20:12.020
This thing is definitely strong.

20:12.270 --> 20:13.860
But that's all he is.

20:14.440 --> 20:17.280
He lacks what it takes
to call himself the Monster King.

20:17.450 --> 20:18.320
Lacks what?

20:19.570 --> 20:21.280
He's not scary at all.

20:21.870 --> 20:23.620
There's not enough fear.

20:24.330 --> 20:25.290
Hmm...

20:25.870 --> 20:29.500
I'll give you...

20:29.830 --> 20:31.130
fear.

20:33.550 --> 20:37.130
<i>What I lack in physical strength,</i>
<i>I'll make up for in technique.</i>

20:43.470 --> 20:45.430
Come on, be afraid!

20:59.110 --> 21:00.700
Are you kidding?

21:00.990 --> 21:02.620
<i>He's using the same stance as me.</i>

21:02.990 --> 21:05.990
Did you think you're the only genius?

21:06.500 --> 21:10.580
He can copy your moves and techniques
just by seeing them once.

21:11.210 --> 21:14.590
Looks like you ended up making
Lord Orochi even stronger.

21:14.880 --> 21:19.300
You want fear? I'll give you fear.

21:21.340 --> 21:25.140
So you managed to copy
my technique with just one look?

21:25.720 --> 21:29.140
How considerate of you to match
my fighting style.

21:30.020 --> 21:31.900
You're too kind.

21:33.060 --> 21:34.820
You'll regret this!

21:42.990 --> 21:45.580
Your obsession with defeating heroes.

21:45.700 --> 21:48.080
Your strong admiration for monsters.

21:48.200 --> 21:52.540
And yet, you show no signs of
monstrous impulses or desires.

21:53.130 --> 21:55.630
Can you not abandon your humanity?

21:56.340 --> 21:57.800
The more pure-hearted they are

21:57.800 --> 22:01.550
the greater the inner conflict,
creating cracks in their heart.

22:02.050 --> 22:05.640
I'll take my time and
thoroughly brainwash you.

22:06.220 --> 22:08.390
You can never have
too many trump cards.

22:08.470 --> 22:13.600
The Hero Association might be hiding
some cards above Class S as well.

22:17.230 --> 22:19.820
There was definitely noise
coming from below.

22:20.150 --> 22:22.610
Hm? But now, it's gone quiet.

22:23.030 --> 22:24.110
OPEN

23:56.000 --> 24:00.980
MOTLEY HEROES
